      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LADY NORTHUMBERLAND.\nO, fly to Scotland,\nTill that the nobles and the armed commons\nHave of their puissance made a little taste.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
